My hair is long.
I only sometimes get a haircut.
I make a phone call to a hair salon.
A woman answers the phone.
She says, "Namaste."
"Hair salon."
I say, "Namaste."
"I want a haircut."
She asks, "When are you coming?"
I say, "I am coming on Saturday."
She asks, "At what time on Saturday?"
I ask, "When is there time in the morning?"
She looks at the schedule.
She says, "There is time at ten o'clock in the morning."
I say, "Not at ten o'clock."
"Is there time at exactly eleven o'clock?"
She looks again.
She says, "Yes, there is time at eleven o'clock."
I say, "Excellent."
"I will come at eleven o'clock."
She asks, "What is your name?"
I say, "My name is Maya."
She says, "Okay Maya madam."
"We will meet on Saturday."
I put down the phone.
My Saturday schedule is now complete.
